:"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:135849","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"プッシュ☆ナルカミー","creatorId":"vndb:s12367","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s12367","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s12367","name":"プッシュ☆ナルカミー","roleCode":"director","roleLabel":"导演","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:135850","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"プッシュ☆ナルカミー","creatorId":"vndb:s12367","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s12367","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s12367","name":"プッシュ☆ナルカミー","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:135851","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"陽向たろ","creatorId":"vndb:s15003","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s15003","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s15003","name":"陽向たろ","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:135852","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c69409","characterName":"佐野 幸大","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"120539","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"294939"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22136"],"vndbCharacterId":"c69409"},"originalCharacterName":"佐野 幸大","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Masaharu's friend and classmate with Chisa, Rie and Yuuki. He is also looking for a girlfriend but he is not as popular as he thinks and there are almost no girls speaking to him to become his friend, only Yuuki and Rie speak friendly to him but they do not see him as a potential romantic interest."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From his unpopularity was born an immense jealousy against Masaharu who, in addition to having a beautiful childhood friend, is surrounded by pretty girls like Chisa, the president of the student council or the pretty little Kouhai named Sumire."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c69409"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"フルキスでも登場。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"声が大きくてうるさいけれど、いいやつ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"千夏を通じて拓也と知り合う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"恋愛の師匠として拓也にあれやこれやと教えていくことになる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22136","sourceWorkId":"28926","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/84/8476ca5226a71aef5d2c3227214ea173cb2061f7ab7adf2409a668dc52ed8ada.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a4/a479386f086edbf237728d3d1a8061459308473d3d60dee5182323ca27e23041.webp","width":92,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"皇 遊雅","creatorId":"vndb:s16203","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s16203","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s16203","name":"皇 遊雅","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:71717","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c58417","characterName":"市原 昌晴","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c58417"},"originalCharacterName":"市原 昌晴","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"175"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Masaharu is Yuuki's childhood friend and classmate with Chisa, Rie and Koudai. Friendly with most people, it is quite easy to approach. Perhaps that's why Youko-senpai, the president of the student council, who has been flirting with him since he arrived in high school, having as much physical contact as possible with him. But it was also thanks to this kindness that he was able to approach Sumire as she tried to approach a young cat and make a friend of her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Unlike his best friend Yuuki, Masaharu is more than interested in love and would like to make a girlfriend but he has never had a chance to make one yet. But will his second year of high school be as unsuccessful as his first year?"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c58417"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/02/0279917bf5e3576d6916a55a8dadb1c9d2cddc9d9ea10cc06b5bbc59e7b1e1ee.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4b/4b56dfc0f63710d7251d3b1335f242ea4b759322d167da80700363ed0c832a6d.webp","width":185,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c61898","characterName":"小松 理恵","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c61898"},"originalCharacterName":"小松 理恵","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Chisa's best friend and classmate with Masaharu, Yuuki and Koudai. She is very social and talks easily with everyone. She knows Chisa's shyness problem and tries to make her feel confident when they talk to boys so that she can overcome it."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c61898"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/97/9707655e4b59dd41db1d667e39ea399b6a6de324b17ec095b3fe993be6a9a0db.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a4/a4c439d18a1daaf80a673c2876e03bd741f966fb4588f5c67a5a9b8a423db50c.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c61899","characterName":"神代 芽衣","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c61899"},"originalCharacterName":"神代 芽衣","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Mei is a third-grade student, Youko's closest friend and classmate. She also acts as vice-president of the student council, a role she firmly and strictly fulfills, not because she is a cold girl but because Youko is losing her concentration very quickly."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, she understands that her friend wants to have a normal high school life without the responsibilities of her role as president, and she relies heavily on Masaharu to entertain her."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c61899"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bf/bfd82d07f9923114322da2d44d6f35bf86ae91612afb631dbdc7d7174b6b8929.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/50/504e8c99b3886b70b90dd8ebf8458c41efeeeaa9af4f1fa8850fb23b5171f307.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"天羽はるか","creatorId":"vndb:s16201","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s16201","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s16201","name":"天羽はるか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:71716","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c61900","characterName":"穂崎 愛奈","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c61900"},"originalCharacterName":"穂崎 愛奈","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sumire's younger sister. She is a very polite young girl, addressing her elders with the greatest respect. However, she is quite frank and does not hesitate to give people nicknames by mixing in their most visible physical asset..."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c61900"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a6/a6ea92de22c1bba9fa975c7203c934a552a169e572f8af4a7afc0ba83f672332.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c5/c5c000ae1d42171f75e63a0c60dcdb64e37b009fce6ae0d7b282e2877f0a16ab.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小鳥遊 このこ","creatorId":"vndb:s271","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s271","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s271","name":"辻 あゆみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:71714","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c82869","characterName":"穂崎 愛奈","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c82869"},"originalCharacterName":"穂崎 愛奈","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"D"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sumire's younger sister a few years later, when she was in high school. After learning as a child that her first love, Masaharu, had become Sumire's boyfriend, she did not lose hope and decided to do everything to become very pretty when she grew up."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Now, she spends most of her time charming Masaharu and telling her sister that men prefer younger girls and that one day she will become his mistress, which bothers Sumire because she doesn't really know if her sister is kidding or not..."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c82869"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/34/34013c4fe8a23d17d3e878f1f35aaee488819f185b3ef0b824d328584948ea08.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/be/be0cbc4313f220d6